{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301030","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130103001:1":{"text":"언니 오빠가 밖에 나가 있는 시간이 점점 더 길어지고 있거든요. 제 생각엔 식량을 구하려고 점점 더 먼 곳으로 가는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"姐姐和哥哥出去的时间越来越久，我猜他们是去到了更远的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6357ACC4A9A272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130103002:1":{"text":"사막 언저리는 항상 식량이 부족한데, 저희가 먹는 양은 계속 늘어나니까요...","source_cn":"荒漠边缘的食物本就稀少，再加上我们吃的越来越多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF70A820BB4FEA2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130103003:1":{"text":"이대론 안 되겠어요! 평생 언니 오빠한테만 기댈 수는 없으니까요. 얼른 뭐라도 해야겠어요!","source_cn":"不行！不能让哥哥姐姐一直为我们寻找食物。我也要行动起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E83276EFE37D343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血赞娜":{"text":"잔느","source":"小蛮血赞娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}